          "settings": {
            "heading": "Introduction",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "content": "<p>The Andy Cab BYD Double Cab Predator canopy is built for strength, style, and adventure. Using advanced composite technology, this lightweight-yet-tough canopy offers rugged durability with a sleek finish. Perfect for overlanders, outdoor explorers, and everyday drivers who need versatile storage and a secure fit – all backed by Andy Cab’s trusted warranties.</p>",
