          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Key Features & Benefits",
            "icon": "star",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>High-Tech Composite Construction</strong> – ultimate strength and durability with a premium, smooth finish.<br/></li><li><strong>Lightweight Powerhouse (55 kg)</strong> – easy on your fuel economy but strong enough to carry a rooftop tent.<br/></li><li><strong>Adventure-Ready Versatility</strong> – side doors and rear entry for quick, all angle access to your gear.<br/></li><li><strong>Custom Colour Options</strong> – match your bakkie and your style with factory quality colour coding.<br/></li><li><strong>Sleek & Secure Design</strong> – bold, off road-ready aesthetics combined with a snug, weatherproof fit.<br/></li><li><strong>Peace of Mind Warranty</strong> – 3-year warranty on the fibreglass shell, 1 year on mechanical parts.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Detailed Description",
            "icon": "heart",
            "content": "<p>When adventure calls, the Andy Cab BYD Double Cab Predator canopy answers.</p><p>Designed with over 20 years of canopy innovation, this model combines cutting-edge materials with practical design features that make life on the road easier.</p><p>Weighing just 55 kg, the Predator is built using high-tech composite technology that balances strength and agility. Whether you’re fitting a rooftop tent for overlanding weekends or simply hauling work gear during the week, this canopy is up for the task.</p><p>Accessing your equipment is effortless thanks to wide-opening side doors and a secure rear entry, giving you multiple points of access without unnecessary hassle. The canopy’s weatherproof seals and UV-resistant coating ensure long-lasting protection against South African sun and rain, while the bold, clean lines elevate your bakkie’s look on and off the road.<br/><br/>Available in multiple colours to match your BYD’s factory paint, the Predator canopy blends seamlessly with your vehicle for a professional, rugged finish. And with Andy Cab’s 3-year shell warranty and 1-year warranty on mechanical items, you can trust it’s<br/>built to last.<br/><br/>For adventurers, overlanders, and hard-working bakkie owners, the BYD Double Cab Predator canopy delivers the best of both worlds: strength without the weight, style without compromise.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_Rx4wqd": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Technical Specifications",
            "icon": "plane",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Feature:\t</strong>Specification</li></ul><p></p><ul><li><strong>Construction:</strong> \tHigh-tech composite material</li><li><strong>Weight:</strong> \tApprox. 55 kg</li><li><strong>Load Capacity:</strong> \tSuitable for rooftop tent</li><li><strong>Access Points:</strong> \tDual side doors + rear door</li><li><strong>Finish:</strong> \tSmooth, UV-resistant coating</li><li><strong>Colour Options:</strong> \tCustom factory colour coding available</li><li><strong>Warranty – Shell:</strong> \t3 years</li><li><strong>Warranty – Mechanical:</strong> \t1 year</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_YjaL4C": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "FAQs",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "content": "<p><strong>Q: Can the Predator canopy handle a rooftop tent?<br/></strong>A: Yes, despite weighing only 55 kg, the Predator is engineered to carry rooftop tents, making it perfect for camping and overlanding.</p><p><strong>Q: Will the canopy match my BYD’s paint colour?<br/></strong>A: Absolutely! The Predator is available in custom factory-matched colours for a seamless finish.<br/><br/><strong>Q: How secure is the Predator canopy?<br/></strong>A: It features a snug fit, weatherproof seals, and lockable access points, ensuring both your gear and your bakkie are protected.<br/><br/><strong>Q: Does Andy Cab offer nationwide fitment?<br/></strong>A: Yes, Andy Cab has nationwide fitment centres across South Africa for convenience and peace of mind.</p>",
            "page": ""
